## 7. Technology Stack [CXC-TECH]

| Layer | Technology | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| GUI framework | CustomTkinter | Consistent with ComposeIO ecosystem; dark mode; the widgets being designed are CTk widgets |
| Bus | `composeio.bus.ComposeIOBus` | Dogfooding; real bus semantics |
| Canvas drawing | `tk.Canvas` via CTk | Lightweight item-based rendering; proven drag/resize handling |
| LVGL preview | `other_widgets.lvgl.LVGLCanvas` | Pixel-accurate embedded preview |
| Schema rendering | `other_widgets.renderers.CTkRenderer`, `LVGLRenderer` | Dual-renderer for schema-based widgets |
| Serialization | PyYAML + custom emitter | ComposeIO YAML output; round-trip fidelity |
| Testing | pytest + mock `ComposeIOBus` | Per-module isolation; bus-driven integration tests |

---

## Relationships

### Causal
- [DP-CXC-1] CAUSES [CXC-DUAL-BUS] — dogfooding requires real bus instances
- [DP-CXC-4] CAUSES [CXC-BUS-DESIGN] — live preview requires real design bus
- [DP-CXC-5] CAUSES [CXC-MOD-ISOLATION] — decomposition requires strict module boundaries

### Semantic
- [CXC-DUAL-BUS] RELATED_TO [DP-CIO-5] — local/global/remote scope model
- [CXC-BUS-CONNECT] RELATED_TO [DP-CIO-6] — transport is implementation detail
- [CXC-RENDER-PREVIEW] DEPENDS_ON `other_widgets.lvgl.LVGLCanvas`
- [CXC-RENDER-PREVIEW] DEPENDS_ON `other_widgets.renderers`

